* 附言\n     */\n    private String remarkMemo;\n\n    /**\n     * 备注\n     */\n    private String additionalRemark;\n\n    /**\n     * 交易码\n     */\n    private String transactionCode;\n\n    /**\n     * 备用字段\n     */\n    private String backupField;\n}","completed":false,"isEnd":false,"failed":false}
