[55864] [2026-01-09 19:58:12] [INFO] [ENGINE]  <--------- ENGINE SEND: VIRTUAL_EDITOR_EVENT {"action":"openVirtualDiffDocument","payload":{"absolutePath":"/Users/xiaoliu/baidu/bpit-proc-apps/pmc/DebugDataFormat.java","content":"","modified":"public class DebugDataFormat {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        // 用户提供的原始数据\n        String userData = \"状态|交易日期|交易时间|业务类型|流水号|流水序号|账号|户名|收支标志|币种|交易金额|余额|可用余额|对方账号|对方户名|对方地址|对方开户行行号|对方开户行行名|票据种类|票据号码|票据名称|票据签发日期|附言|备注|交易码|备用\\n\" +\n                \"0|20251105|093003|2|EBB0001P70190041|1|310069079018800073806|怒访址撵鉴遮斌粤惨佣|D|CNY|100.00|11991096.17|0|81100614850188002002204|僧铃抬鲸届系括冉翘损御缎缠||01110146999|交通银行北京广渠路支行||||||q2yuyh5004#测试1|101700||\\n\" +\n                \"0|20251105|093022|2|EBB0001P70080041|2|310069079018800073806|怒访址撵鉴遮斌粤惨佣|D|CNY|100.00|11990996.17|0|81100614850188002002205|僧铃抬鲸届系括冉翘损御缎缠||01110146999|交通银行北京广渠路支行||||||q2yuyh50054#测试1|101700||\";\n\n        System.out.println(\"=== 数据格式分析 ===\");\n        \n        String[] lines = userData.split(\"\\n\");\n        System.out.println(\"总行数: \" + lines.length);\n        System.out.println();\n        \n        // 分析表头\n        System.out.println(\"📋 表头分析:\");\n        String headerLine = lines[0];\n        String[] headerFields = headerLine.split(\"\\\\|\", -1);\n        System.out.println(\"表头字段数量: \" + headerFields.length);\n        for (int i = 0; i < headerFields.length; i++) {\n            System.out.println(\"  \" + i + \": '\" + headerFields[i] + \"'\");\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println();\n        \n        // 分析数据行\n        for (int i = 1; i < lines.length; i++) {\n            System.out.println(\"📊 第\" + i + \"行数据分析:\");\n            String dataLine = lines[i];\n            String[] dataFields = dataLine.split(\"\\\\|\", -1);\n            System.out.println(\"数据字段数量: \" + dataFields.length);\n            \n            for (int j = 0; j < dataFields.length; j++) {\n                System.out.println(\"  \" + j + \": '\" + dataFields[j] + \"'\");\n            }\n            System.out.println();\n            \n            // 检查是否存在字段数量不一致的问题\n            if (dataFields.length != headerFields.length) {\n                System.out.println(\"⚠️ 字段数量不匹配: 表头\" + headerFields.length + \"个 vs 数据\" + dataFields.length + \"个\");\n            }\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(\"=== 字段对应关系分析 ===\");\n        String[] headerFields2 = lines[0].split(\"\\\\|\", -1);\n        String[] dataFields2 = lines[1].split(\"\\\\|\", -1);\n        \n        int maxLen = Math.max(headerFields2.length, dataFields2.length);\n        for (int i = 0; i < maxLen; i++) {\n            String header = i < headerFields2.length ? headerFields2[i] : \"[无]\";\n            String data = i < dataFields2.length ? dataFields2[i] : \"[无]\";\n            System.out.printf(\"%2d. %-15s => %s%n\", i, header, data);\n        }\n    }\n}","stream":true,"source":"E2EBotConversation","acceptable":true,"action":"edit","openFileDiff":false,"conversationId":"20fec48e-734a-4cda-b6a7-4b56823ff21d","elementId":"6960ed3ff87c787b160b39fa","inlineView":true,"uuid":"cd1f420b-6f18-49d4-9683-852110d5cd9a"}}
