* 票据号码\n     */\n    private String billNumber;\n\n    /**\n     * 票据名称\n     */\n    private String billName;\n\n    /**\n     * 票据签发日期\n     */\n    private String billIssueDate;\n\n    /**\n     * 附言\n     */\n    private String remarkMemo;\n\n    /**\n     * 备注\n     */\n    private String additionalRemark;\n\n    /**\n     * 交易码\n     */\n    private String transactionCode;\n\n    /**\n     * 备用字段\n     */\n    private String backupField;\n}\n","stream":true,"source":"E2EBotConversation","acceptable":true,"action":"edit","openFileDiff":false,"conversationId":"20fec48e-734a-4cda-b6a7-4b56823ff21d","elementId":"6960ee1652ad0b146922d32d","inlineView":true,"uuid":"c7a97508-6ff5-48b0-b29e-76dc43bd53ca"}}
